0911834.000113\",\n              \"quote\": \"Two reviewers read the same phrase differently because of regional vocabulary. Can both reviewers indicate the locale assumptions behind their scores?\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Did the task specify northern or southern Vietnamese?\",\n          \"evidence\": [\n            {\n              \"member_id\": \"member_3e91ba29f70cf52ce570367f\",\n              \"message_id\": \"1790881883.000226\",\n              \"quote\": \"Did the task specify northern or southern Vietnamese? A Southern usage should not be dismissed solely because a Northern reviewer prefers another term.\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ],\n      \"open_questions\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Should we penalize a response that answers half in English?\",\n          \"evidence\": [\n            {\n              \"member_id\": \"member_3e91ba29f70cf52ce570367f\",\n              \"message_id\": \"1790915152.000144\",\n              \"quote\": \"It answers half in English — penalize? (task ref MULTI-5152)\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ],\n      \"supported_answers\": [],\n      \"uncertainties\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"The thread does not establish a clear decision on how to handle the task regarding the use of 'bắp'.\",\n          \"evidence\": [\n            {\n              \"member_id\": \"member_62b6d45e0363dcb0bbba7579\",\n              \"message_id\": \"1790881784.000184\",\n              \"quote\": \"The thread does not establish a clear decision on how to handle the task regarding the use of 'bắp'.\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"The thread does not establish a clear decision on whether to penalize the response.\",\n          \"evidence\": [\n            {\n              \"member_id\": \"member_3e91ba29f70cf52ce570367f\",\n              \"message_id\": \"1790915152.000144\",\n              \"quote\": \"T